{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "6fe4a7fb59cb812cb0649535e4b1f091d5779ec84d56d19c13a9d040735d3499", "ja": "もっと景色が見えるように", "zh": "为了能更看清外面的景色", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868fea43b213e02b5ab4c6ee154dae00478898dd22f30231979114b8374eef55", "ja": "4人の公演は大成功。打ち上げは美術館へ。\r\n難解な展示にロコ以外は戸惑い、結局いつも\r\nのファミレスへ。まだまだわからない事はあ\r\nるけど、少しずつ理解できるように成長して\r\nいこう、と誓い合う一同だった。", "zh": "4人的公演大获成功。庆功会则是去了美术馆。\n除了ROCO以外的人都对晦涩难懂的展品感到困惑，最终还是去了平时常去的家庭餐厅。尽管还有很多弄不明白的事，但大家互相立下誓言，要不断成长，逐渐去理解它们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "835e7df43275656c371ec4621a6a8f345314e518a37b8104e9e548a7022123ad", "ja": "（北東エリア最初の公演は、大成功！　メディアにも\n大きく取り上げてもらい、予想以上の反響を得られた）", "zh": "（东北地区的首场公演大获成功！媒体也进行了大篇幅报道，得到了超出预想的反响。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dabe52115cf479a020171780fccb9f84fd9d110368eb0db3f8d96a580716feb3", "ja": "打ち上げはみんなの希望で美術館か……。\n納得のチョイスだけど、よかったのか？", "zh": "庆功会按大家的希望去美术馆吗……。这个选择我能理解，不过这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2e8247704331eacce638be4d640ac5cda87ec644332ce47694de50217a37926", "ja": "はい。この間の美術館、\nとっても面白かったので♪", "zh": "是的。因为上次去的那家美术馆特别有意思♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "72d9e80d8f1e34faafc0f7c6c23f239dec4ffa106ea05b2374f14bd0098d0688", "ja": "そういう方向性の評価もいただいたので……\nせっかくだから、理解を深めようって思ったんです。", "zh": "因为也收到了这方面的评价……\n难得有这个机会，我就想着加深一下理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b4950c6b93b4860db780a1531e1721a102d5f10f91b71b3975050017e05c77b", "ja": "『芸術的な美しさ』って書かれてたよね！\nもしかして、女子力もグーンとあがったかも！？", "zh": "上面写着“艺术般的美丽”吧！说不定连女生魅力也大幅提升了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "7521965d041109b230d4d5a9248c2d88facc3a3fcf1917137a164f29ea30e473", "ja": "みんながアートへのモメンタムを高めている……\nロコはそれだけでハッピーです♪", "zh": "大家对艺术的热情越来越高涨了……\nROCO光是这样就很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ea5003e2280e7963ce6c95bb9f471f3b47a473e470e75399f4ac2b366ff6f3d3", "ja": "はは、いい傾向だな。今日の展示は『形而上的に\nみる現代アートの今～形象の哲学史～』……。", "zh": "哈哈，这是个好现象。今天的展览是《从形而上学角度看现代艺术的当下～形象的哲学史～》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "40de687836aae8b71d65855ccd7d06dbbb89ea57501e77f6ed5d1b49f5f1da38", "ja": "あまり聞いたことのない単語が並んでるけれど……\n今回はどういった展示なのかしら？", "zh": "净是一些平时不太听得到的词呢……\n这次到底是什么样的展览呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "a791c042f2238264299f7b19a2f1670a0c9e1f435bd24959a8cda0127d61dff2", "ja": "コンテンポラリーアートについて……\nロコ的にはとってもインタレスティングです！", "zh": "关于当代艺术……从ROCO的角度来看，真的非常有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "341578738e91478d915d864a18296b5032dfe22ba987ebce2e99458faeb27ab2", "ja": "よくわからないですけど……\nまずは触れてみるのが大事だと思います！", "zh": "虽然我还不是很明白……\n但我觉得首先亲自去接触一下是很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "eb77fe30893ec61364839d3ccd23d8568e26c735a258139dc5792b69856beda0", "ja": "うん。この間みたいに、歩き回ってるうちに\n楽しめちゃうと思う！　それじゃあ、レッツゴー！", "zh": "嗯。我觉得会像上次那样，到处逛逛\n就能乐在其中了！那么，我们出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1011_null", "source_sha256": "f44cec8435ce211c17fb1fdfa89fe7be29e50723d360db63398940ba3abf9a5d", "ja": "展示鑑賞後……", "zh": "参观展览后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "fd32c1c21231d8a6d539f79003b57ef4d01c4d37c15e40b0e7b05af3ff5a5caa", "ja": "宇宙って、生命って、なんだろう……？\nどうしてみんないきてるんだろう……。", "zh": "宇宙究竟是什么，生命又是什么呢……？\n大家为什么都活着呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "a1379f8473b454a43bf8fc15ce86aa7770413aa07274b36564d81e7e52b1ec3d", "ja": "真理、運命……\nすべては裏返し……？", "zh": "真理、命运……\n一切都是相反的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "517f69154938f4647938c0bed9a4fb32a6bf579d3680618b905c94b09c79210b", "ja": "…………ピーーーーーーーーッ。", "zh": "…………哔————。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "7ea8a21c767fc7a8765080fee420569a50a442d760928c887983804d99714466", "ja": "み、みんな、カムバックです～！？\nちょっと、ディープすぎたでしょうか……？", "zh": "大、大家，回、回来了～！？\n刚才是不是有点太深入了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f314fcae364ebc1f98d2d18c00621cbe7e9cedd9898f12fc1842fc9e1fd1c8c7", "ja": "展示内容から、なんとなくこうなる予感は\nしてたよ……。よし、こういう時は……！", "zh": "看了展览内容，就隐约有种会变成这样的预感了\n……好，这种时候就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "81a326d5c88f5c9acd5afbfb1863a4c743f5e76eff7f5af9436090bec571aed6", "ja": "ふう、いつもより多めに食べちゃった♪\nごはんは元気の源だね☆", "zh": "呼，今天吃得比平时多了点♪\n吃饭可是活力的源泉呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "3adbc23d5e40027834ab24382436a5afb7950d02a0fb9c63d249fe97f960bb33", "ja": "わたしもおなかがいっぱいになったら、\n落ち着いてきました……♪", "zh": "我肚子吃饱之后，\n也平静下来了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "16a03f9cd3c9b609aabdfc503d5715c40e96271b3ce8bc4f84e7e38d8527b403", "ja": "ハングリーだと、クレバーにはなれませんから。\nロコもクールダウンです。", "zh": "肚子饿的话，就没法保持聪明冷静呢。\nROCO也冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "605d7c6455a06342998e581881bb98ea3c904b9f8991e38fee832ec43987ca04", "ja": "私も落ち着いてきたわ。みんなそろって、\nお腹が空き過ぎていたのかしら……？", "zh": "我也渐渐冷静下来了。难道大家都是饿过头了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "31fdf48d10256deeec9bc2558ed934f528316cb454e31233f318ad08fd55ef95", "ja": "はは……。結局いつも通りの打ち上げになって\nしまいましたけど、やっぱり悪くないものですね。", "zh": "哈哈……结果还是变成了和平时一样的庆功宴，不过这样果然也不坏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d81d68f009cfb73087887216918f234dea64799e55e2ef0730d0d24308f9448", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたしたちに\n現代アートは、まだ早かったんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。对我们来说，\n欣赏现代艺术还是太早了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a2d8e4b71d5385ff3321cee895ea7badced8f74591d75f7dfbfaec7b63fb5552", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。まあ、あの展示は\n確かに難しい内容だったけど……。", "zh": "没那回事。虽然那个展览的内容确实很难懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b419133844ae99f99557d701a9ff8fe3092c0ac8fddd93542411b4e04b52046c", "ja": "ずっとわからないってわけじゃないはずだ。\nコンテンポラリーダンスだって、そうだっただろう？", "zh": "不至于一直都理解不了。\n现代舞不也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "57642d9a2f0fa08a53aa04c5fdcaad402fda4987dd1e45be33333469f7acf08d", "ja": "そうですね……最初はわからないなんて、\n本当はよくあることで……。", "zh": "是啊……一开始不明白，其实是很常见的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "d7588a35eb7bd284cc08dc8759c52f955e8364a083249e6558930e3d2e478aa4", "ja": "でもそれは、これから理解していくものって、\n言い換えることもできるはずだから。", "zh": "不过，也可以换个说法，那就是有些事情本来就是要从现在开始慢慢理解的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "66689987e88ab11dae9f9e4139fea7300d248fbb881c87656318f36bb37c1d8a", "ja": "これから理解していくもの……\nそっか、そうですよね……！", "zh": "今后要逐渐理解的东西……\n这样啊，确实是这样呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d30debb7b95de8e1372f76c5f2267c8aa361154cd9bf3d097f1155535a39ebc", "ja": "これからもわたし、ちゃんと自分の目や耳で、\n確かめていきたいと思います！", "zh": "今后我也想用自己的双眼和双耳，认真去确认！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "39e9df010e871190acab7a22548ccee615eadff7d6de6392972a528782c0f181", "ja": "ええ。一歩一歩、進んでいきましょうね。\nそれでも悩む時は、一緒に悩んだっていいんだもの。", "zh": "嗯。让我们一步一步地继续前进吧。\n即使遇到烦恼，一起烦恼也没关系呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "5de2b4adbfa2b74f74ca79d22632fc32b34e31e74d20480ecf35e86a694b9bb8", "ja": "私も私も！　体力だったら、\nいくらでも貸しちゃうからね☆", "zh": "我也是我也是！要是体力的话，\n想借多少都可以借给你哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "0b1742e865c733119e3e722e430685ff81b736b22ca31786c214b95cd7d10c43", "ja": "ロコもオブザーバーになります！　ブレストに\nディスカッション、いつでもウェルカムです♪", "zh": "ROCO也会担任观察员！头脑风暴和讨论，随时欢迎♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "af0fceb77ae782d6f439557a2bcdb738414fb3b22200d51bdfb5ef1c36a7f00b", "ja": "みなさん、ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、さっそく……。", "zh": "大家，非常感谢！\n那么，事不宜迟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "8ab7484d5139cbc401818150bfa8a0c2da337ae47a2d4495413d7fa967b1ee35", "ja": "もう一回、あの美術館に行ってもいいですか？\nおなかいっぱいで元気もいっぱいだから、今なら……！", "zh": "可以再去一次那座美术馆吗？\n现在吃得饱饱的，精神也很充足，所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9c5f027cd1ac05d298d03b2ad65fd2d2f56ec7d3575db2b5fb676f51cbcba833", "ja": "待ってくれ、星梨花！　段階を踏まえて……今日は\n別フロアの、『絵本の中のおやつ』展とかどうだ？", "zh": "等等，星梨花！我们循序渐进吧……今天\n要不要去其他楼层的“绘本里的点心”展看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd822fed262b14478b3ac4849b1d640296a6429bd66419f8c131c9615fcde563", "ja": "『絵本の中のおやつ』……！\nなんだか、とっても素敵です！", "zh": "“绘本里的点心”……！\n总觉得特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1036_010azu", "source_sha256": "4f192fbf02dc395fe9d095490b9a88882fa46fff8177b49b22c309cb8d2a2e89", "ja": "まあ、とってもかわいらしい展示♪\n私も興味がわいてきちゃった。うふふ♪", "zh": "哎呀，好可爱的展览♪\n我也提起了兴趣呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "8d718803fd4e39cb01eb30711f950661a3351bf05149e604790ee8adb83176f2", "ja": "私も興味ある！　筋トレに\n最適なおやつもあったりするかな……？", "zh": "我也很感兴趣！不知道有没有适合锻炼肌肉时吃的零食呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "c3eb6438aee5444e69e7e89f7900f3b1feaca3613b67d163dc1aaed225d0abb6", "ja": "キュートでファンシーなアート、ロコは\nフェイバリットですよ♪　さっそく行ってみましょう！", "zh": "可爱又梦幻的艺术，ROCO最喜欢了♪我们马上去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e2eb4c8dcb1b50e0f2cf25501ad4ffd5bc7d8bcf2d3c29ce1f0f46138fa0fc05", "ja": "（わからないものがわかっていくほど、\nみんなの可能性も拡がっていくはず……）", "zh": "（越是不明白的事情变得明白，\n大家的可能性也一定会不断拓展……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "9781fe62c26cfa3f2d412905b4efee7908a68558f18e0f270793fefa9fb221e2", "ja": "（こうして少しずつ成長していく姿、\nこれからも一番近くで見守らせてもらおう！）", "zh": "（就让我今后也继续在离她们最近的地方，守望着她们一点一点成长的身影吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
